WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.030 --> 00:00:04.230
Life is full of uncertainty.

00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:11.630
In many ways, we are both the driver and the
passenger of our lives.

00:00:11.630 --> 00:00:18.430
With strong self-discipline, we can make decisions
that allow us to predict and control certain

00:00:18.430 --> 00:00:22.420
things on the surface of our life.

00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:28.750
Things like what we do for work, where we
live, whom we associate with, and how we choose

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:31.850
to live our daily life.

00:00:31.850 --> 00:00:38.410
But even with strong intellect, reason, and
self-discipline, there is still a whole realm

00:00:38.410 --> 00:00:42.489
of life that we cannot be sure about.

00:00:42.489 --> 00:00:48.770
Possibilities that we can only speculate,
but can never fully control.

00:00:48.770 --> 00:00:53.409
Like the chance of falling out of love or
having a friend betray us.

00:00:53.409 --> 00:00:57.899
The chance of early death, tragedy, or health
conflicts.

00:00:57.899 --> 00:01:05.199
Or the chance that things we hold to be true
end up not being so.

00:01:05.199 --> 00:01:07.280
All of which is possible.

00:01:07.280 --> 00:01:12.340
And all of which, in general, is out of our
control.

00:01:12.340 --> 00:01:20.750
This creates deep conflict because as humans,
control is one of our greatest hungers.

00:01:20.750 --> 00:01:27.649
With control comes certainty, and with certainty,
we would no longer have the fear of things

00:01:27.649 --> 00:01:31.250
going wrong for us or our loved ones.

00:01:31.250 --> 00:01:34.920
But life does not work this way.

00:01:34.920 --> 00:01:43.260
More often, life functions on its own terms
within the laws of its own arbitrariness.

00:01:43.260 --> 00:01:45.310
So what do we do?

00:01:45.310 --> 00:01:52.729
How can we live knowing that behind any corner
could be something that might ruin us?

00:01:52.729 --> 00:01:57.700
How can we live with this irrevocable fear?

00:01:57.700 --> 00:02:05.780
We cannot eliminate uncertainty, but we CAN
rationalize the fear that stems from it.

00:02:05.780 --> 00:02:12.680
In life, one of the only things we have true
heightened control over is our thoughts and

00:02:12.680 --> 00:02:13.680
perspectives.

00:02:13.680 --> 00:02:21.000
And we must use what we CAN control to override
our fear of what we cannot.

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:30.750
If we wish to overcome fear, we must spotlight
our consciousness and rationality onto it.

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:37.409
We can do this by constantly reminding ourselves
of this; if we live in fear of what may or

00:02:37.409 --> 00:02:44.959
may not happen, we will spend our life detached
from reality, suffering from things that do

00:02:44.959 --> 00:02:47.510
not even exist.

00:02:47.510 --> 00:02:55.740
We will be our own worst enemy, self-inflicting
anxiety with no purpose and taking our self

00:02:55.740 --> 00:03:04.410
away from enjoying the present moment, which
would otherwise be precious and untainted.

00:03:04.410 --> 00:03:13.080
For example, if we fear that we might become
badly ill or injured from an unforeseen occurrence,

00:03:13.080 --> 00:03:20.790
fear will not decrease the chances of becoming
ill or injured, but what it WILL do is create

00:03:20.790 --> 00:03:24.120
unnecessary suffering.

00:03:24.120 --> 00:03:31.819
And if we do, by some unfortunate circumstances
become ill or injured, we would have wasted

00:03:31.819 --> 00:03:37.879
the portion of our life when we were healthy,
living with the mental consequences of being

00:03:37.879 --> 00:03:40.099
unhealthy.

00:03:40.099 --> 00:03:47.680
And therefore, fearing uncontrollable concepts
of the future simply does not make any rational

00:03:47.680 --> 00:03:48.680
sense.

00:03:48.680 --> 00:03:56.500
It only brings unnecessary anxiety about that
which does not exist, and takes us away from

00:03:56.500 --> 00:04:00.069
enjoying that which does.

00:04:00.069 --> 00:04:02.900
Uncertainty is not something to be afraid
of.

00:04:02.900 --> 00:04:05.409
It cuts both ways.

00:04:05.409 --> 00:04:12.069
If it is possible that unforeseen negative
things can happen in life, then it is also

00:04:12.069 --> 00:04:17.540
possible that unforeseen positive things can
happen to us in life.

00:04:17.540 --> 00:04:26.490
And it is this concept of randomness and unpredictability
that keeps life exciting.

00:04:26.490 --> 00:04:34.389
The only thing we can do in life is try our
best to enjoy our time in spite of fear, so

00:04:34.389 --> 00:05:01.100
if our fears do come true, at least we enjoyed
ourselves before 

00:05:01.100 --> 00:05:06.120
the storm.

